Wait, what bed did you say she was on?

542
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:01,010
Mine.

543
00:26:01,100 --> 00:26:03,000
I'm sure I put her on my bed.

544
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,760
No, she was definitely on my bed.

545
00:26:04,760 --> 00:26:06,820
Why would I kiss a girl and then put her on your bed?

546
00:26:08,700 --> 00:26:10,060
Well, then who was on my bed?

547
00:26:10,307 --> 00:26:12,087
Oh, oh, oh...

548
00:26:14,166 --> 00:26:15,816
No! No! No!

549
00:26:16,110 --> 00:26:17,440
Yes!

550
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:20,320
You were under the pile of coats?

551
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:22,560
I was the pile of coats!

552
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:27,560
Oh, my God!

553
00:26:29,280 --> 00:26:32,080
You were my midnight mystery kisser?!

554
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:35,920
You were my first kiss with Rachel?!

555
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:39,640
You were my first kiss ever?!

556
00:26:42,780 --> 00:26:44,440
What did I marry into?!

557
00:27:19,810 --> 00:27:21,390
Crap!

